      "value": "I've noticed the same. with the Network Object Info overlay enabled the Df (whatever that mean) of ObjectSynced pickups rise as long as they are being held(capping at 4000ms) seems to maybe get worse if more items are held. \n\nAfter some investigation I've found that objects that have only a pickup script and a vrcobjectsync script suffer from the issue. Pickups that have another synced behavior(like a toggle) do not seem to have this issue.\n\nI'm stumped.",
